# Atlas News — environment variable template.
#
# DO NOT put real secret values in this file. Copy to `.env` for local
# development only (`.env` is gitignored). For production, set these as
# GitHub Actions secrets at: Settings → Secrets and variables → Actions.
#
# THE DEFAULT SETUP NEEDS NO KEYS — every variable below is OPTIONAL.

# Optional: FRED API key for historical macro context.
# Get one free at https://fred.stlouisfed.org/docs/api/api_key.html
# FRED_API_KEY=

# Optional: override the default ticker watchlist (comma-separated).
# Yahoo symbols — equities use plain tickers, FX uses =X suffix.
# WATCHLIST=NVDA,TSLA,SPY,XAUUSD=X,AMZN,AAPL,META

# Optional: time zone for displayed event times in `data.json`.
# Defaults to Australia/Sydney. Any IANA tz name works.
# DISPLAY_TZ=Australia/Sydney
